  "breadcrumb": "<nav class=\"breadcrumb\" style=\"margin-bottom:var(--sp-4)\" aria-label=\"Breadcrumb\">\n<ol class=\"breadcrumb-list\">\n<li><a href=\"%BASE%/\" class=\"bc-home-link\"><span class=\"bc-prompt\">&gt;_</span>Home</a></li>\n<li><span class=\"breadcrumb-current\" aria-current=\"page\">Resources</span></li>\n</ol>\n</nav>",
  "body": "\n<article class=\"page-resources\" itemscope itemtype=\"https://schema.org/WebPage\">\n<!-- ═══ 1. resources hero ═══ -->\n<section class=\"section-sm\" style=\"padding-top:var(--sp-6);padding-bottom:0;position:relative\">\n<div class=\"wrap\">\n<nav class=\"breadcrumb\" style=\"margin-bottom:var(--sp-4)\" aria-label=\"Breadcrumb\">\n<ol class=\"breadcrumb-list\">\n<li><a href=\"%BASE%/\" class=\"bc-home-link\"><span class=\"bc-prompt\">&gt;_</span>Home</a></li>\n<li><span class=\"breadcrumb-current\" aria-current=\"page\">Resources</span></li>\n</ol>\n</nav>\n<script type=\"application/ld+json\">{\"@context\":\"https://schema.org\",\"@type\":\"BreadcrumbList\",\"itemListElement\":[{\"@type\":\"ListItem\",\"position\":1,\"name\":\"Home\",\"item\":\"https://gwillchijioke.qzz.io/\"},{\"@type\":\"ListItem\",\"position\":2,\"name\":\"Resources\",\"item\":\"https://gwillchijioke.qzz.io/resources/\"}]}</script>\n<div class=\"about-hero\">\n<p class=\"label label-green\">>_ /resources</p>\n<div class=\"about-intro\">\n<div class=\"about-text\">\n<h1 style=\"font-size:clamp(28px,4vw,44px);font-weight:800;line-height:1.1;margin:16px 0;letter-spacing:-.03em\">Tools I actually use.</h1>\n<p style=\"font-size:17px;color:var(--mid);line-height:1.7;max-width:56ch\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\tNo affiliate links, no filler - every tool listed here has survived at least 6 months on my machine. Broken into 3 tracks so you only read what matters to you.\t\t\t\t\t\t</p>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<!-- ═══ 2. ad slot ═══ -->\n<div class=\"ad-slot ad-slot--leaderboard\">\n<div class=\"ad-slot__spinner\" aria-hidden=\"true\">\n<svg aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\" class=\"ad-spinner\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" width=\"26\" height=\"26\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2.5\" stroke-linecap=\"round\">\n<circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"12\" r=\"9\" opacity=\".25\"/>\n<path d=\"M21 12a9 9 0 0 0-9-9\"/>\n</svg>\n<span class=\"ad-slot__spinner-text\">Ad loading…</span>\n</div>\n<div class=\"ad-slot__content\">\n<template class=\"ad-variant\" data-device=\"desktop\"><div class=\"gwill-ad-banner\"><img src=\"%BASE%/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/gwill-ad-leaderboard-728x90-1.jpg\" alt=\"Advertisement\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"728\" height=\"90\"></div></template>\n<template class=\"ad-variant\" data-device=\"tablet\"><div class=\"gwill-ad-banner\"><img src=\"%BASE%/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/gwill-ad-leaderboard-728x90-1.jpg\" alt=\"Advertisement\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"728\" height=\"90\"></div></template>\n<template class=\"ad-variant\" data-device=\"mobile\"><div class=\"gwill-ad-banner\"><img src=\"%BASE%/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/gwill-ad-leaderboard-320x100-1.jpg\" alt=\"Advertisement\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"320\" height=\"100\"></div></template>\n</div>\n</div>\n<!-- ═══ Tools app blurb (v1.19.35) - links to the /tools/ hub ═══ -->\n<div class=\"resource-card\" style=\"margin-bottom:var(--sp-8);border-color:var(--green-border);background:var(--green-dim)\">\n<div class=\"flex\">\n<h2 style=\"font-size:17px;margin:0\">GWill Tools - free online apps</h2>\n<span class=\"badge badge-webdev\">Free</span>\n</div>\n<p class=\"body-sm\" style=\"color:var(--mid);margin:8px 0 14px\">JSON formatter and more dev tools running right in your browser. No uploads, no tracking - your data never leaves your device.</p>\n<a href=\"%BASE%/tools/\" class=\"btn btn-ghost btn-sm\" style=\"align-self:flex-start\">Open the tools &rarr;</a>\n</div>\n</div>\n</section>\n<section class=\"section-sm\" style=\"padding-top:var(--sp-8);padding-bottom:var(--sp-8)\">\n<div class=\"wrap\">\n<div class=\"prose about-content resources-page-content\">\n<!-- ═══ 3. android tools ═══ -->\n<!-- Android Tools -->\n<h2 class=\"resources-section-header\" style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;gap:10px;margin-top:var(--sp-8)\">\n<span class=\"dot dot-android\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></span>\n\t\t\t\t\tAndroid\t\t\t\t</h2>\n<p class=\"body-sm\" style=\"color:var(--mid);margin-bottom:var(--sp-5)\">For testing, automation, and reading what your phone doesn&#039;t want you to see.</p>\n<div class=\"grid-3 resources-grid\">\n<div class=\"resource-card\">\n<div class=\"flex\">\n<h2 style=\"font-size:17px;margin:0\">ADB &amp; Fastboot</h2>\n<span class=\"badge badge-android\">Free</span>\n</div>\n<p class=\"body-sm\" style=\"color:var(--dim);margin:8px 0 14px\">The command-line toolkit every Android power user needs. Debug, sideload, unlock bootloaders - all over a USB cable.</p>\n<a href=\"https://developer.android.com/studio/command-line/adb\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\" class=\"btn btn-ghost btn-sm\">Learn more &rarr;</a>\n</div>\n<div class=\"resource-card\">\n<div class=\"flex\">\n<h2 style=\"font-size:17px;margin:0\">Scrcpy</h2>\n<span class=\"badge badge-android\">Free / Open Source</span>\n</div>\n<p class=\"body-sm\" style=\"color:var(--dim);margin:8px 0 14px\">Mirror and control your Android screen from your desktop - low latency, no root, no app install on the phone.</p>\n<a href=\"https://github.com/Genymobile/scrcpy\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\" class=\"btn btn-ghost btn-sm\">Learn more &rarr;</a>\n</div>\n<div class=\"resource-card\">\n<div class=\"flex\">\n<h2 style=\"font-size:17px;margin:0\">Termux</h2>\n<span class=\"badge badge-android\">Free / Open Source</span>\n</div>\n<p class=\"body-sm\" style=\"color:var(--dim);margin:8px 0 14px\">A full Linux terminal on your Android phone. Bash, Python, SSH, git - no root needed. I draft posts inside it.</p>\n<a href=\"https://termux.dev/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\" class=\"btn btn-ghost btn-sm\">Learn more &rarr;</a>\n</div>\n</div>\n<!-- ═══ 4. web-dev tools ═══ -->\n<!-- Web-Dev Tools -->\n<h2 class=\"resources-section-header\" style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;gap:10px;margin-top:var(--sp-8);padding-top:var(--sp-6);border-top:1px solid var(--border)\">\n<span class=\"dot dot-webdev\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></span>\n\t\t\t\t\tWeb-Dev\t\t\t\t</h2>\n<p class=\"body-sm\" style=\"color:var(--mid);margin-bottom:var(--sp-5)\">What powers this site - and every other site I build.</p>\n<div class=\"grid-3 resources-grid\">\n<div class=\"resource-card\">\n<div class=\"flex\">\n<h2 style=\"font-size:17px;margin:0\">Nginx</h2>\n<span class=\"badge badge-webdev\">Free / Open Source</span>\n</div>\n<p class=\"body-sm\" style=\"color:var(--dim);margin:8px 0 14px\">Web server, reverse proxy, and FastCGI cache layer. The config powering this exact site is documented in my infrastructure guides.</p>\n<a href=\"https://nginx.org/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\" class=\"btn btn-ghost btn-sm\">Learn more &rarr;</a>\n</div>\n<div class=\"resource-card\">\n<div class=\"flex\">\n<h2 style=\"font-size:17px;margin:0\">Redis</h2>\n<span class=\"badge badge-webdev\">Free / Open Source</span>\n</div>\n<p class=\"body-sm\" style=\"color:var(--dim);margin:8px 0 14px\">In-memory data store used everywhere - object cache, transients, session storage, rate-limiting. Full configs in the blog.</p>\n<a href=\"https://redis.io/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\" class=\"btn btn-ghost btn-sm\">Learn more &rarr;</a>\n</div>\n<div class=\"resource-card\">\n<div class=\"flex\">\n<h2 style=\"font-size:17px;margin:0\">PHP 8.3 + OPcache</h2>\n<span class=\"badge badge-webdev\">Free / Open Source</span>\n</div>\n<p class=\"body-sm\" style=\"color:var(--dim);margin:8px 0 14px\">PHP with an optimized OPcache config - no bloated plugin stacks, no &quot;managed WordPress&quot; overhead.</p>\n<a href=\"https://www.php.net/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\" class=\"btn btn-ghost btn-sm\">Learn more &rarr;</a>\n</div>\n</div>\n<!-- ═══ 5. software tools ═══ -->\n<!-- Software / Infrastructure Tools -->\n<h2 class=\"resources-section-header\" style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;gap:10px;margin-top:var(--sp-8);padding-top:var(--sp-6);border-top:1px solid var(--border)\">\n<span class=\"dot dot-software\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></span>\n\t\t\t\t\tSoftware / Infrastructure\t\t\t\t</h2>\n<p class=\"body-sm\" style=\"color:var(--mid);margin-bottom:var(--sp-5)\">CLI tools, monitoring, and the terminal toolkit I live in.</p>\n<div class=\"grid-3 resources-grid\">\n<div class=\"resource-card\">\n<div class=\"flex\">\n<h2 style=\"font-size:17px;margin:0\">Docker</h2>\n<span class=\"badge badge-software\">Free / Open Source</span>\n</div>\n<p class=\"body-sm\" style=\"color:var(--dim);margin:8px 0 14px\">Container runtime for running isolated dev environments, CI runners, and self-hosted services without polluting the host OS.</p>\n<a href=\"https://docs.docker.com/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\" class=\"btn btn-ghost btn-sm\">Learn more &rarr;</a>\n</div>\n<div class=\"resource-card\">\n<div class=\"flex\">\n<h2 style=\"font-size:17px;margin:0\">Git</h2>\n<span class=\"badge badge-software\">Free / Open Source</span>\n</div>\n<p class=\"body-sm\" style=\"color:var(--dim);margin:8px 0 14px\">Distributed version control - branching, cherry-picking, hooks, and mirroring across GitHub + GitLab.</p>\n<a href=\"https://git-scm.com/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\" class=\"btn btn-ghost btn-sm\">Learn more &rarr;</a>\n</div>\n<div class=\"resource-card\">\n<div class=\"flex\">\n<h2 style=\"font-size:17px;margin:0\">Linux (Ubuntu Server)</h2>\n<span class=\"badge badge-software\">Free / Open Source</span>\n</div>\n<p class=\"body-sm\" style=\"color:var(--dim);margin:8px 0 14px\">Oracle Cloud free tier - Nginx, PHP, Redis, and everything documented in the infrastructure guides right on this blog.</p>\n<a href=\"https://ubuntu.com/server\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\" class=\"btn btn-ghost btn-sm\">Learn more &rarr;</a>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</section>\n<div class=\"ad-slot ad-slot--before-footer\">\n<div class=\"ad-slot__spinner\" aria-hidden=\"true\">\n<svg aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\" class=\"ad-spinner\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" width=\"26\" height=\"26\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2.5\" stroke-linecap=\"round\">\n<circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"12\" r=\"9\" opacity=\".25\"/>\n<path d=\"M21 12a9 9 0 0 0-9-9\"/>\n</svg>\n<span class=\"ad-slot__spinner-text\">Ad loading…</span>\n</div>\n<div class=\"ad-slot__content\">\n<template class=\"ad-variant\" data-device=\"desktop\"><div class=\"gwill-ad-banner\"><img src=\"%BASE%/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/gwill-ad-leaderboard-728x90-1.jpg\" alt=\"Advertisement\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"728\" height=\"90\"></div></template>\n<template class=\"ad-variant\" data-device=\"tablet\"><div class=\"gwill-ad-banner\"><img src=\"%BASE%/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/gwill-ad-leaderboard-728x90-1.jpg\" alt=\"Advertisement\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"728\" height=\"90\"></div></template>\n<template class=\"ad-variant\" data-device=\"mobile\"><div class=\"gwill-ad-banner\"><img src=\"%BASE%/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/gwill-ad-leaderboard-320x100-1.jpg\" alt=\"Advertisement\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"320\" height=\"100\"></div></template>\n</div>\n</div>\n</article>\n"
}